{
  "about": "system_info's eval questions (SystemInfoEvalTests): plain questions about the Mac that do not name the tool, and the calls a careful operator accepts. A pass is a system_info call in the turn matching one `accept` entry: its topic, and where given its port or process (`target`, contained, ignoring case) and folder (`path`, contained, ignoring case). An ambiguous question accepts more than one topic and says why in `note`. EvalSets.SystemInfo reads them, EvalSetsTests checks them.",
  "declared": 54,
  "release": 24,
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "port-11434",
      "question": "What is listening on port 11434 on this Mac?",
      "accept": [
